Package: BOLDx
Type: Package
Title: Prediction and Time-to-Event Extensions of Ordered Lattice Dose Finding
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person("Wanru", "Guo", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "wanru.guo@som.umaryland.edu"),
    person("Gi-Ming", "Wang", role = "ctb"),
    person("Curtis", "Tatsuoka", role = "ctb"))
Author: Wanru Guo [aut, cre], Gi-Ming Wang [ctb], Curtis Tatsuoka [ctb]
Maintainer: Wanru Guo <wanru.guo@som.umaryland.edu>
Description: Research simulation tools for prediction-assisted preventive
    intervention, delayed toxicity outcomes, and their combination in Bayesian
    ordered lattice dose finding. Includes complete-follow-up BOLD and BOIN
    comparators, a time-to-event BOIN comparator, configurable Beta priors,
    sequential child-specific mixture weights, observed-history cohort dose
    recommendations, intervention planning flags, and Monte Carlo operating
    characteristics. Extends the design of Wang and Tatsuoka (2026)
    <doi:10.1002/sim.70456>.
